{
    "title": "MLB Perfect Inning 24",
    "description": "Officially licensed MLB Baseball Game!\r\nDive into an MLB live mobile baseball game, featuring the 2023 Willie Mays World Series\u00ae MVP, Corey Seager!\r\nExperience the unique thrill of the real-time PvP baseball game in MLB Perfect Inning 24!\r\n\r\n[About the Game]\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Officially Licensed MLB Baseball Game\r\nUpdated team logos, uniforms, rosters, and ballparks for the 2024 season!\r\nPerfect integration of the official MLB designated runner rule for extra innings!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Detailed MLB Player Features on Mobile!\r\n- Check out subtle details in player appearances, including skin tone and physique!\r\n- Say hello to your favorite MLB stars in full 3D!\r\n- Experience upgraded pitching and batting styles!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Meet MLB Hall of Fame Legends\r\n- New Prime Legend Player Cards Appear!\r\n- Introducing Greg Maddux, Hank Aaron, David Ortiz, and Trevor Hoffman!\r\n- Recruit legends and play baseball in your own unique style!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Be the Perfect Inning Champion\r\n- Participate in the PI Championship and vie for ultimate supremacy among 1,024 contenders!\r\n- Come out on top and win the glorious champion ring, exclusive to the PI Championship!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Distinctive Sports Game Featuring 15 on 15 Co-Op Club Battle\r\n- Engage in real-time 15 on 15 PvP baseball games with your club members!\r\n- It's showtime! Relive the best moments of Club Battle!\r\n- Win in the Club League and reap massive rewards!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Engage in Battle Slugger Mode with MLB Star Players\r\n- Hit the incoming pitches out of the park in this single player mode!\r\nWe\u2019ve got a home run-hitting PvP mode for you!\r\n- Select the best pitchers and batters in your roster, and form the ultimate Battle Slugger duo lineup!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Ultimate Pitching and Batting Controls\r\n- Enjoy more realistic and enjoyable controls!\r\n- Freely switch between auto and manual play!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Simulated Baseball for Faster Progress and Increased Realism\r\n- Experience the excitement of the All-Star Game, and the moment of two outs, bases loaded!\r\n- Simulate live season games for all nine innings!\r\n\r\n> MLB Perfect Inning 24 Official Forum\r\nhttps://mlbpi-community.com2us.com\r\n> MLB Perfect Inning 24 Official Facebook Page\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MLBPI\r\n> MLB Perfect Inning 24 Official X Account\r\nhttps://twitter.com/MLB__PI\r\n\r\nMajor League Baseball trademarks and copyrights are used with the permission of Major League Baseball. Visit MLB.com for more details. Officially Licensed Product of MLB Players, Inc., MLBPA trademarks, copyrighted works, and other intellectual property rights are owned and/or held by MLBPA and may not be used without the written consent of MLBPA or MLB Players, Inc. Visit MLBPLAYERS.com, the Players Choice on the web.\r\n\r\n** This game is available in \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, English, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4, Espa\u00f1ol\r\n** The game includes in-game purchases. Please note that some items require additional payments.\r\n\r\nMinimum Requirements:\r\nOS 5.1 and 3 GB RAM\r\n\r\n\u25b6 We do not request permissions while you are using this app.\r\n\r\n* Com2uS Holdings Official Website: https://www.withhive.com\r\n* Com2uS Holdings Customer Support: https://customer-m.withhive.com/ask\r\n\r\nContact Developers\r\nE-mail: help@com2us.com\r\nAddress: 4F, Building A, 131, Gasan digital 1-ro, Geumcheon-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea\r\nPhone Number: 02-1588-4263\r\nBusiness Registration Number: 119-81-34778 (Republic of Korea)\r\nMail Order Sales Registration Number: \uc81c 2019-\uc11c\uc6b8\uae08\ucc9c-0855\ud638 (Republic of Korea)\r\nRegistration Agency: Geumcheon-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea",
    "descriptionHTML": "Officially licensed MLB Baseball Game!<br>Dive into an MLB live mobile baseball game, featuring the 2023 Willie Mays World Series\u00ae MVP, Corey Seager!<br>Experience the unique thrill of the real-time PvP baseball game in MLB Perfect Inning 24!<br><br>[About the Game]<br><br>\u25a0 Officially Licensed MLB Baseball Game<br>Updated team logos, uniforms, rosters, and ballparks for the 2024 season!<br>Perfect integration of the official MLB designated runner rule for extra innings!<br><br>\u25a0 Detailed MLB Player Features on Mobile!<br>- Check out subtle details in player appearances, including skin tone and physique!<br>- Say hello to your favorite MLB stars in full 3D!<br>- Experience upgraded pitching and batting styles!<br><br>\u25a0 Meet MLB Hall of Fame Legends<br>- New Prime Legend Player Cards Appear!<br>- Introducing Greg Maddux, Hank Aaron, David Ortiz, and Trevor Hoffman!<br>- Recruit legends and play baseball in your own unique style!<br><br>\u25a0 Be the Perfect Inning Champion<br>- Participate in the PI Championship and vie for ultimate supremacy among 1,024 contenders!<br>- Come out on top and win the glorious champion ring, exclusive to the PI Championship!<br><br>\u25a0 Distinctive Sports Game Featuring 15 on 15 Co-Op Club Battle<br>- Engage in real-time 15 on 15 PvP baseball games with your club members!<br>- It&#39;s showtime! Relive the best moments of Club Battle!<br>- Win in the Club League and reap massive rewards!<br><br>\u25a0 Engage in Battle Slugger Mode with MLB Star Players<br>- Hit the incoming pitches out of the park in this single player mode!<br>We\u2019ve got a home run-hitting PvP mode for you!<br>- Select the best pitchers and batters in your roster, and form the ultimate Battle Slugger duo lineup!<br><br><br>\u25a0 Ultimate Pitching and Batting Controls<br>- Enjoy more realistic and enjoyable controls!<br>- Freely switch between auto and manual play!<br><br>\u25a0 Simulated Baseball for Faster Progress an